POST http://localhost:9909/api/sessions/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "juanbautistajrsabadu@gmail.com",
    "password": "juan1234"
}

### Creamos un ticket nuevo -> Deberia devolver 201
POST http://localhost:9909/api/events/6abf07369cf194bbd75a47ac/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "quantity": 2
